class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_M,b_M,c_M\">\\(a_M,b_M,c_M\\)</span>, carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_3\">\\(M_3\\)</span>, diamond operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_M,\\vee_M\">\\(\\wedge_M,\\vee_M\\)</span>, and algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M_3\">\\(\\mathbf M_3\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc98242032b14823\" href=\"?note=fc98242032b14823\" title=\"93-df-distributive-lattice\">93-df-distributive-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\na_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,1\\rangle,\n\\quad b_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,2\\rangle,\n\\quad c_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,3\\rangle,\n\\quad A_M\\coloneqq\\{a_M,b_M,c_M\\},\n\\quad M_3\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup A_M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\na_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,1\\rangle,\n\\quad b_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,2\\rangle,\n\\quad c_M\\coloneqq\\langle5,3\\rangle,\n\\quad A_M\\coloneqq\\{a_M,b_M,c_M\\},\n\\quad M_3\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\}\\cup A_M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\nx\\wedge_M y&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n0,&amp;x\\neq y\\land(x=0\\lor y=0\\lor x,y\\in A_M),\\\\\ny,&amp;x=1,\\\\\nx,&amp;y=1,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nx\\vee_M y&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n1,&amp;x\\neq y\\land(x=1\\lor y=1\\lor x,y\\in A_M),\\\\\ny,&amp;x=0,\\\\\nx,&amp;y=0,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad(x,y\\in M_3),\\\\\n\\mathbf M_3&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle M_3,\\wedge_M,\\vee_M\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\nx\\wedge_M y&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n0,&amp;x\\neq y\\land(x=0\\lor y=0\\lor x,y\\in A_M),\\\\\ny,&amp;x=1,\\\\\nx,&amp;y=1,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nx\\vee_M y&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\nx,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n1,&amp;x\\neq y\\land(x=1\\lor y=1\\lor x,y\\in A_M),\\\\\ny,&amp;x=0,\\\\\nx,&amp;y=0,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad(x,y\\in M_3),\\\\\n\\mathbf M_3&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle M_3,\\wedge_M,\\vee_M\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\n\\wedge_M,\\vee_M:M_3^2\\to M_3\n\\land\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf M_3)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathbf M_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}modular\\text{-}nondistributive}\\vdash\n\\wedge_M,\\vee_M:M_3^2\\to M_3\n\\land\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathbf M_3)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}(\\mathbf M_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The displayed tables determine the diamond without relying on an informal diagram. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{M}_3\">\\(\\mathbf{M}_3\\)</span> is the smallest non-distributive modular lattice.\nIt is realized exactly as the subspace lattice of the two-dimensional vector\nspace <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F_2^2\">\\(\\mathbb F_2^2\\)</span>: the three atoms are its three one-dimensional subspaces.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-modular-nondistributive---Modular-Non-Distributive","text":"ex-modular-nondistributive - Modular Non-Distributive","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-modular-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-modular-identity","status":"resolved","id":"bcf5fa8a7fd2252e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-modular-identity]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-modular-lattice]] and [[93-df-distributive-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"fc98242032b14823","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{DistributiveLat}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-modular-lattice]] and [[93-df-distributive-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a_M,b_M,c_M","display":false},{"tex":"M_3","display